			<article id="post-462762" class="post-462762 post type-post status-publish format-standard hentry category-1982">
	
	<div class="entry-meta"><span class="posted-on"><a href="https://etaiwan.news/2026/03/06/%e5%8f%b0%e6%9d%b1%e5%9b%9d%e4%bb%94%e7%8e%8b%e6%98%a5%e6%a2%85%ef%bd%9c%e8%a1%a8%e6%85%8b%e5%8f%83%e9%81%b8%e7%b8%a3%e8%ad%b0%e5%93%a1/" rel="bookmark"><time class="entry-date published" datetime="2026-03-06T17:42:05+08:00">2026 年 3 月 6 日</time><time class="updated" datetime="2026-03-06T17:43:50+08:00">2026 年 3 月 6 日</time></a></span><span class="byline"> <span class="author vcard"><a class="url fn n" href="https://etaiwan.news/author/a2227929/">張柏東</a></span></span></div>
		<h1 class="entry-title">
		台東囝仔王春梅｜表態參選縣議員	</h1>

	<div class="entry-content">
		
<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img data-recalc-dims="1" decoding="async" width="506" height="850" data-attachment-id="462763" data-permalink="https://etaiwan.news/img_8227-12/" data-orig-file="https://i0.wp.com/etaiwan.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/img_8227.jpg?fit=506%2C850&amp;ssl=1" data-orig-size="506,850" data-comments-opened="1" data-image-meta="{&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;1&quot;}" data-image-title="img_8227" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-large-file="https://i0.wp.com/etaiwan.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/img_8227.jpg?fit=506%2C850&amp;ssl=1" src="https://i0.wp.com/etaiwan.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/img_8227.jpg?resize=506%2C850&#038;ssl=1" alt="" class="wp-image-462763" srcset="https://i0.wp.com/etaiwan.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/img_8227.jpg?w=506&amp;ssl=1 506w, https://i0.wp.com/etaiwan.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/img_8227.jpg?resize=179%2C300&amp;ssl=1 179w" sizes="(max-width: 506px) 100vw, 506px" /><figcaption class="wp-element-caption"><strong>王春梅</strong></figcaption></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">「我是台東的女兒，我回來了！」立法委員黃仁的夫人、被親切稱為「台東囝仔」的王春梅，3/6日正式向廣大台東鄉親報到。秉持著對家鄉的深厚情感，王春梅將與立委黃仁攜手並進，以最接地氣的服務，落實「攜手前進、與您同行」的承諾，成為鄉親最堅實的依靠。</p>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img data-recalc-dims="1" decoding="async" width="1024" height="623" data-attachment-id="462760" data-permalink="https://etaiwan.news/img_8224-15/" data-orig-file="https://i0.wp.com/etaiwan.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/img_8224.jpg?fit=1087%2C661&amp;ssl=1" data-orig-size="1087,661" data-comments-opened="1" data-image-meta="{&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;1&quot;}" data-image-title="img_8224" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-large-file="https://i0.wp.com/etaiwan.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/img_8224.jpg?fit=1024%2C623&amp;ssl=1" src="https://i0.wp.com/etaiwan.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/img_8224.jpg?resize=1024%2C623&#038;ssl=1" alt="" class="wp-image-462760" srcset="https://i0.wp.com/etaiwan.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/img_8224.jpg?resize=1024%2C623&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/etaiwan.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/img_8224.jpg?resize=300%2C182&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/etaiwan.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/img_8224.jpg?resize=768%2C467&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/etaiwan.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/img_8224.jpg?w=1087&amp;ssl=1 1087w" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /><figcaption class="wp-element-caption"><strong>王春梅｜向您報到</strong></figcaption></figure>



<figure class="wp-block-image size-large"><img data-recalc-dims="1" decoding="async" width="1024" height="623" data-attachment-id="462761" data-permalink="https://etaiwan.news/img_8225-17/" data-orig-file="https://i0.wp.com/etaiwan.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/img_8225.jpg?fit=1087%2C661&amp;ssl=1" data-orig-size="1087,661" data-comments-opened="1" data-image-meta="{&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;1&quot;}" data-image-title="img_8225" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-large-file="https://i0.wp.com/etaiwan.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/img_8225.jpg?fit=1024%2C623&amp;ssl=1" src="https://i0.wp.com/etaiwan.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/img_8225.jpg?resize=1024%2C623&#038;ssl=1" alt="" class="wp-image-462761" srcset="https://i0.wp.com/etaiwan.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/img_8225.jpg?resize=1024%2C623&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/etaiwan.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/img_8225.jpg?resize=300%2C182&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/etaiwan.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/img_8225.jpg?resize=768%2C467&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/etaiwan.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/img_8225.jpg?w=1087&amp;ssl=1 1087w" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /><figcaption class="wp-element-caption"><strong>王春梅｜學經歷豐富</strong></figcaption></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">從台東出發：不忘初心的「台東女兒」王春梅女士出生於台東，成長過程深受這片土地孕育的純樸與堅毅影響。即便多年來隨著夫婿投身公共服務與社會公益，她始終心繫家鄉的發展與長輩、族人的福祉。王春梅表示，台東不只是她的家，更是她服務的起點。</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">「台東人的事，就是我王春梅的事。我帶著回饋家鄉的心，要用女性溫柔而堅定的力量，為台東注入更多溫暖。」</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">攜手前進：中央與地方的服務一條龍<br />作為立委黃仁最得力的夥伴，王春梅此次站到第一線，不僅是為了傳遞黃仁立委在國會的努力，更是要化身為「行動辦公室」，直接深入部落與鄰里，傾聽最真實的聲音。</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">未來，王春梅將專注於以下三大服務重點：<br />在地關懷： 關心部落長者照護、偏鄉教育資源，確保福利政策落實。<br />傾聽民意： 建立直接溝通管道，將台東的需求第一時間傳達到中央。<br />公益同行： 結合社會資源，推動在地文化傳承與弱勢族群扶助。<br />與您同行：點亮台東的未來</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">王春梅強調，政治不應只是高層的決策，更應是鄰里間的相互扶持。她邀請所有鄉親與她同行，無論是地方建設的建議，還是生活中的大小困難，「台東囝仔」王春梅都將全力以赴，與鄉親站在一起。</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">「攜手前進，與您同行」不只是一句口號，更是王春梅對台東最深情的告白。</p>
